-- ==========================================================
-- Abinash Catering — Real Menu Seed Data
-- Transcribed directly from the physical Abinash Catering menu
-- card (2 images: dinner menus 1-6, breakfast 1-3, lunch 1-2,
-- the non-veg "காரைக்குழ சமையல்" set, and the add-on services list).
--
-- Run AFTER schema.sql. Safe to re-run: upserts on
-- (menu_section, name_tamil), so it will never duplicate rows.
--
-- NOTE ON ITEM #9 of "டின்னர் மெனு - 1":
-- One dish name on the physical card was not legible enough to
-- transcribe with confidence (glare/blur on the printed card).
-- It has been inserted with is_available = false and a review
-- note so it does not show on the live site until the owner
-- confirms the correct name and flips it to available.
--
-- ENGLISH NAMES:
-- The `name` column has been filled in with English translations of
-- every legible dish (the one exception above stays blank). Confirm
-- these are correct before publishing — in particular, every dish in
-- "காரைக்குழ சமையல்" is prefixed "சைவ" ("veg") on the physical card even
-- though the dishes themselves are fish/prawn/crab/meat items; that
-- prefix has been dropped from the English name rather than guessed at.
-- ==========================================================

on conflict (menu_section, name_tamil) do update set
  name = excluded.name,
  category = excluded.category,
  display_order = excluded.display_order;

